  "notes": [
    "**Mudar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **mudado** (regular)",
    "Often used reflexively: **mudarse** (to move - change residence)",
    "Multiple meanings:",
    "To change (clothes, appearance)",
    "To move (residence): *mudarse de casa*",
    "To shed (skin, feathers): animals molting",
    "Common usage: *Me mudé a una casa nueva* (I moved to a new house), *mudar de ropa* (to change clothes)",
    "Related noun: **la mudanza** (move, moving - as in moving house)",
    "Don't confuse with **mover** (to move something physically from one place to another)"
  ],
